<title>USA: Associated Tech gets Philippines contract.</title>
<headline>Associated Tech gets Philippines contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associated Technologies Inc said on Friday that it has signed a $2 million agreement to provide equipment for eight commercial radio stations in the Mindanao region of the Southern Philippines.</p>
<p>The agreement calls for three new turn-key studio installations and the refurbishment of another five stations, Associated Technologies said.</p>
<p>Work is expected to commence on the project in the first week of July, the company said.</p>
</text>
